## 成就页面：展示与分享

用户的成就页面按稀有度分组展示所有成就（已解锁 + 未解锁），未解锁的显示为灰色锁定状态：

```html
@for (group of achievementGroups(); track group.rarity) {
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 opacity-60">{{ group.label }}</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
      @for (ach of group.achievements; track ach.id) {
        <div class="rounded-xl border p-3 text-center transition-all"
             [class]="ach.unlocked
               ? 'border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/5 hover:bg-amber-500/10'
               : 'border-[var(--color-border-card)]/30 opacity-40 grayscale'">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-2">{{ ach.unlocked ? ach.icon : '🔒' }}</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold truncate">{{ ach.unlocked ? ach.titleZH : '???' }}</div>
          @if (ach.unlocked) {
            <div class="text-xs text-amber-400 mt-1">+{{ ach.points }} pts</div>
          }
        </div>
      }
    </div>
  </div>
}
```

